   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC Phase-out Management Plan,(Stage II, Second Tranche</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the success of Lao PDR in implementing the Stage II, first tranche of HCFC phase-out management plan, Stage II, Second Tranche was approved at the 94th Intersessional Meeting of the Executive Committee of the Multilateral Fund for the Implementation of the Montreal Protocol held in June 2024. This approval aims to assist Laos PDR in complying with the 2030-2040 control measures for HCFCs under the Montreal Protocol. The main activities are i) Purchasing a set of equipment and tools</narrative>
  </description>
